  "title": "Soft Sugar Cookies With White Chocolate, Almonds, and Cranberries",
  "description": "Packed with white chocolate chips, almonds, and dried cranberries, these delightful soft sugar cookies taste just like Christmas.",
  "authors": [
    "Debbie Kohler"
  ],
